 194:       `pscale noig4|8' / `ipl noig4|8' (the print-only bodies), and announce-once per
 195:       width by `latch same' / `latch samew' / `latch samed'; SCCERR is E at every width.
 196:       Landed lanes under a fall-through, len 4 / len 8: MASK 0xdd/0x44, VECBASE
 197:       0xd0/0x40, TxCTL 0x01/0x00, TxICR 0x15/0x04, SCCICR and SCCTX (`& 0x1f') 0x1d/0x04,
